    "one_slot_is_what_the_data_supports": "it is where the interference curve flattens and where the wasted compute collapses; see per_dose and summary_k_ge_2 rather than a restated figure here",
    "where_it_does_not_help": "at one or two abandoned decodes a gate is neutral to slightly worse for a patient caller, because the retry hint is a whole number of seconds while one decode is a few seconds -- the sleeping column shows that cost, and it belongs to the hint rather than to the engine",
