    "note": "Retry-After is a whole number of seconds (RFC 7231 delta-seconds) and is taken from the service's own measured p50, so a refused caller sleeps several seconds here. That is why only the larger doses come out ahead. Any refinement of the hint has to be priced against this table rather than assumed."
